# Secrets: 1 present on the device, not changed (--secrets pushes them).
# Cleanup (--converge): the region below is the whole output: it removes 1 line: TACACS+ servers the
# standard does not have. Paste it only after you have checked that the pull of lab-j is current
# (tacctl device config pull lab-j --diff reads ok for aaa, and a NEW ssh session as yourself works).
# The switch undoes this by itself in 5 minutes unless you type the one word after the check (see
# below).
# Paste over ssh, not the console; on a console paste at most twenty lines at a time and watch the
# echo for 'error:'. Pasting the region twice is harmless.
#
# Type this first, on lab-j, and check the name:   show version | match Hostname
# The prompt must end in > (operational mode) before you paste: a prompt ending in # means a
# configuration session is open: stop.
#
##### CLEANUP FROM HERE: lab-j #####
configure private
# aaa: removes the servers the standard does not have
delete system tacplus-server 192.0.2.99
show | compare | no-more
commit check
commit confirmed 5 comment "tacctl cleanup lab-j <time> by alice"
